(7737529, 1275544, 173844, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly, this is the only image of someone actually using their nose, and this brings the sensation all the closer, and his pleasure, and being able to imagine yourself in his place. And it''s a strong image, the balanced composition that fills the frame, the harmonious tones and colors, the latter bearing on burgundy.  Highly satisfying.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Surprisingly, this is the only image of someone actually using their nose, and this brings the sensation all the closer, and his pleasure, and being able to imagine yourself in his place. And it''s a strong image, the balanced composition that fills the frame, the harmonious tones and colors, the latter bearing on burgundy.  Highly satisfying.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-01-31 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737531, 1275641, 173844, '<td valign="top">Commanding situation, enclosed by cheese, breathing its air, the chill and damp (or dry, what do I know) feel.  The stone wall, the aura of age.  The aroma seems almost tangible, thick and insistent.  Also, the depth of field suits the scene, being narrow and the cheeses fading away, an implication of abundance.  When you took the picture did you request, "say cheeeeze."  ?  Rises hardily to the challenge.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Commanding situation, enclosed by cheese, breathing its air, the chill and damp (or dry, what do I know) feel.  The stone wall, the aura of age.  The aroma seems almost tangible, thick and insistent.  Also, the depth of field suits the scene, being narrow and the cheeses fading away, an implication of abundance.  When you took the picture did you request, "say cheeeeze."  ?  Rises hardily to the challenge.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2023-01-31 21:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
